"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"109b0b8d7ee4cec9\" href=\"?note=109b0b8d7ee4cec9\" title=\"72-df-wkl0\">72-df-wkl0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89c91257b92fc1e7\" href=\"?note=89c91257b92fc1e7\" title=\"72-df-aca0\">72-df-aca0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b0618eb9c08a1bca\" href=\"?note=b0618eb9c08a1bca\" title=\"72-df-atr0\">72-df-atr0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da3a454fea13ee06\" href=\"?note=da3a454fea13ee06\" title=\"72-df-pi11-ca0\">72-df-pi11-ca0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0834bea6989e10f4\" href=\"?note=0834bea6989e10f4\" title=\"72-df-buchholz-psi\">72-df-buchholz-psi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d09902009c3b686f\" href=\"?note=d09902009c3b686f\" title=\"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"446dc4361d624e0f\" href=\"?note=446dc4361d624e0f\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0\">72-df-epsilon-0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Carlucci–Mainardi–Rathjen2019 <a href=\"https://eprints.whiterose.ac.uk/id/eprint/147185/1/cie19_sub%20Endversion%20submitted.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://eprints.whiterose.ac.uk/id/eprint/147185/1/cie19_sub Endversion submitted.pdf</a>; Ch.IV §3; Simpson SOSOA §§IX.2–IX.5 (only introduction locally read); Feferman ID saga p10 <a href=\"https://math.stanford.edu/~feferman/papers/id-saga.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://math.stanford.edu/~feferman/papers/id-saga.pdf</a>; Buchholz1986 p195 <a href=\"https://epub.ub.uni-muenchen.de/3841/1/3841.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://epub.ub.uni-muenchen.de/3841/1/3841.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-partially-supported; RCA0 value checked in author paper; WKL0 conservation checked only in author introduction; full ordinal analyses not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>各系统取本目录明确的公理定义，使用其PR保守扩展；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T|\">\\(|T|\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0,\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0,\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 分别如同名定义；坍缩函数严格采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0834bea6989e10f4\" href=\"?note=0834bea6989e10f4\" title=\"72-df-buchholz-psi\">72-df-buchholz-psi</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathsf{RCA}_0|=|\\mathsf{WKL}_0|=\\omega^\\omega,\\qquad|\\mathsf{ACA}_0|=\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad|\\mathsf{ATR}_0|=\\Gamma_0,\\qquad|\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0|=\\psi_0(\\Omega_\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathsf{RCA}_0|=|\\mathsf{WKL}_0|=\\omega^\\omega,\\qquad|\\mathsf{ACA}_0|=\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad|\\mathsf{ATR}_0|=\\Gamma_0,\\qquad|\\Pi^1_1\\operatorname{-CA}_0|=\\psi_0(\\Omega_\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>RCA0的ω^ω值还逐项核对Carlucci–Mainardi–Rathjen2019作者稿引言（PDF2）；WKL0对RCA0的Π¹₁保守性见Simpson IX.2，本次仅读作者导论的对应总结，完整证明未重建。各值是固定Π¹₁可证良序约定下的标准分析，不能混用全归纳ATR与ATR0。ACA0的一阶保守性不单独足以推出任意Π¹₁序数等式；需相应Π¹₁归约。Γ0的ATR0上下界可见Feferman的作者综述ID saga p10所指原证明。Buchholz1986 p195给出Π¹₁CA0对有限ID并的算术保守性及ψ₀Ωω处的PRWO不可证性；这些是最后一式的关键证据，但不把这一小段当作完整上界证明。此复合定理仍标记来源陈述核对、完整分析未重建，不充当已验证依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-base-system","status":"resolved","id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-base-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-wkl0","status":"resolved","id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-wkl0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-aca0","status":"resolved","id":"89c91257b92fc1e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-aca0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-atr0","status":"resolved","id":"b0618eb9c08a1bca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-atr0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-pi11-ca0","status":"resolved","id":"da3a454fea13ee06","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-pi11-ca0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-buchholz-psi","status":"resolved","id":"0834bea6989e10f4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-buchholz-psi]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"d09902009c3b686f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0","status":"resolved","id":"446dc4361d624e0f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0]]","embed":false